दंष्ट्रिन्-<BR> a. id. ;<BR> m. animal muni de défenses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=STC&page=296,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=stc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

