दुःखिन्-<BR> a. affligé, chagriné, malheureux ;<BR> दुःखिता- f.<BR>affliction, chagrin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=STC&page=310,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=stc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

