पुनस्तराम्<BR> adv. toujours de nouveau.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=STC&page=438,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=stc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

