यियक्षु
यियक्षु-<BR> a. qui a l'intention de sacrifier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=STC&page=591,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=stc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

