हनन|हननं|हननः
हनन-<BR> nt. fait de disparaître ;<BR> de tuer, frapper, détruire, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=STC&page=884,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=stc" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनु|हनुः
